### Get checkins
GET http://localhost:7075/api/playgrounds/1/checkins
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create checkin
POST http://localhost:7075/api/playgrounds/1/checkins
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "child_ids": [1],
  "planned_check_in": "2026-04-07T12:00",
  "planned_check_out": "2026-04-07T14:00",
  "user_id": 1

}

### Check-in (arrival)
PUT http://localhost:7075/api/checkins/1/checkin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Checkout
PUT http://localhost:7075/api/playgrounds/1/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1
}

### Create checkin
POST http://localhost:7075/api/playgrounds/6/checkins
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "child_ids": [1],
  "user_id": 1

}

###

### Create checkin
POST http://localhost:7075/api/playgrounds/1/checkins/checkin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "child_ids": [1],
  "check_in": "2026-05-25T14:00:00"
}
###
PUT http://localhost:7075/api/playgrounds/1/checkins/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}